# ./run-tests.sh, Windows 11 + RTX 3060, 2026-11-28 - the review pass
#
# Same environment as evidence/2026-11-28-windows/suite-timings.log: OFX_SOURCE_DIR,
# ONNXRUNTIME_ROOT=.validation/ort-1.32.0, VULKAN_SDK=.validation/vk/sdk, no CPU_ONLY.
# The script runs under set -euo pipefail, so reaching its summary block is itself the
# exit-0 evidence: a failing suite aborts the run before it. Header lines and the
# summary are kept; the full 2,300-line log stayed in .validation/, untracked.

